# Scene2-0-1

; ========================================
; ●シーン2-0‐1
; ========================================

@PlayBgm BgmPath:Bgm_35_1 Volume:1 Loop:true FadeInDuration:0
@AutoSave
[PrintTextModified Text:——我非常重要的朋友自杀了。|#0201Adv02_Narrative001| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:她叫月代雪。|#0201Adv02_Narrative002| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ResetText
@ModifyBackgroundExtended Id:Stills Scale:{g_backgroundDefaultScale} Duration:0 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:150_1
@ModifyBackgroundExtended TintColor:#000000 Duration:1.2 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:Transparent SubId:Overlay
@Wait WaitMode:1.8

[PrintTextModified Text:当我推开房门时，<br>那根上吊绳还静静地悬挂在原地。|#0201Adv02_Narrative003| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我抬头怒视那根为她准备好的绞索。|#0201Adv02_Narrative004| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我将背脊挺得笔直，<br>视线穿过那为了扼住她的咽喉而存在的圆环——<br>过于刺眼的憎恶，让我咬紧了牙关。|#0201Adv02_Narrative005| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我无法原谅。<br>无法原谅小雪的生命，就这么被区区一根绳子夺走。|#0201Adv02_Narrative006| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:对我而言，这是不可饶恕的行为。<br>对我而言，这是不正确的行为。|#0201Adv02_Narrative007| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我最崇尚的就是【正确】。|#0201Adv02_Narrative008| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:这个世界上，<br>不该允许有哪怕一丝一毫的错误存在。|#0201Adv02_Narrative009| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:清澈的湖水中若是掺入一滴毒素，<br>生灵便会死绝。|#0201Adv02_Narrative010| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:精致的画布上若是划出一道划痕，<br>艺术的价值便随之泯灭。|#0201Adv02_Narrative011| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:完美的和声中若是混进一个错误的音符，<br>就会沦为刺耳的不协和音。|#0201Adv02_Narrative012| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:祈盼着正确的大脑中<br>若是寄生了一只害虫——|#0201Adv02_Narrative013| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:整个世界，便会崩塌。|#0201Adv02_Narrative014| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyBackgroundExtended Id:Stills Scale:{g_backgroundDefaultScale} Duration:0.5 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:150_2

[PrintTextModified Text:——在绞索圆环的彼端，<br>我看见了造就这个错误世界的罪魁祸首。|#0201Adv02_Narrative015| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:樱羽艾玛。|#0201Adv02_Narrative016| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:从那一刻起，<br>“自杀”成为了在我心中最不可触碰的【禁忌】。|#0201Adv02_Narrative017| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@Gosub Path:System/System_Subroutine.EndAdv

@GotoModified Path:Act02_Chapter01/Act02_Chapter01_Adv03 SoftReset:true

